OL,3,AStudents strike across Germany in
OL,4,Aprotest against military service
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchool strikes are taking place across
OL,7,FGermany to protest against the possible
OL,8,Freintroduction of compulsory military
OL,9,Fservice.
OL,11,FOne of the organisers of the strike,
OL,12,FBela Breitner, from School Strike
OL,13,FAgainst Compulsory Military Service
OL,14,Fsaid the federal government was
OL,15,F"serious about gradually reintroducing
OL,16,Fcompulsory military service".
OL,18,FAt one protest in Hamburg,
OL,19,Fdemonstrators waved flags and held up
OL,20,Fbanners emblazoned with the words "We
OL,21,Fwon't take part in your wars".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
